MID_MV12_00: <SH>
MID_MV12_00_m001: (panic cries)
MID_MV12_00_m002: A reaction...
MID_MV12_00_m003: That weapon you got...is that a Hero's Relic?
MID_MV12_00_m004: Been peddling my wares all over the world from\nFódlan to Dagda and I've never seen one like that.
MID_MV12_00_m005: And these wares are all I got—\nmore precious than my life.
MID_MV12_00_m006: But that blade...
MID_MV12_00_m007: Tell me—what's it called?
MID_MV12_00_m008: Its name? Answerer.
MID_MV12_00_m009: Ooh! I've heard of that one.
MID_MV12_00_m010: The fell blade...
MID_MV12_00_m011: A thing of legend. Said to have been wielded by the\nvery hand of one of the 10 Elites—by Lamine herself!
MID_MV12_00_m012: Is it true that a single swing cut down an ancient\ntree and left behind nothing but a chasm below?
MID_MV12_00_m013: Who can say?
MID_MV12_00_m014: What's it gonna take for you to\nsell me that beautiful thing, huh?
MID_MV12_00_m015: This storm won't last forever. I gotta start\nthinking about my next moves. Haha.
MID_MV12_00_m016: *gasp/gulp*
MID_MV12_00_m017: *caught breath*
MID_MV12_00_m018: Breach! Breach in the hull! Water coming in!
MID_MV12_00_m019: Start bailing it out, and quick!
MID_MV12_00_m020: (walla: panicking)
MID_MV12_00_m021: Oh, goddess! Save us, Seiros!
MID_MV12_00_m022: *surprise react*
MID_MV12_00_m023: Look there! Beneath the waves!
MID_MV12_00_m024: Something's...glowing!
MID_MV12_00_m025: Eyes...they're eyes! It's staring right at us!
MID_MV12_00_m026: (walla: realizing something and being shocked)
MID_MV12_00_m027: Beautiful...
MID_MV12_00_m028: (crying out, sliding down ship deck)
MID_MV12_00_m029: (crying out, sliding down ship deck)
MID_MV12_00_m030: *bracing react*
MID_MV12_00_m031: The Crest of Blaiddyd?
MID_MV12_00_m032: Who are you?
MID_MV12_00_m033: Who indeed...